{
    "title": "Dungeon Manager : Mine King",
    "description": "Defend against monster waves and other users\r\nand become the world's most powerful dungeon manager!\r\n\r\n\u2605 Simple Hero Management - Arm them with powerful skills and items!\r\nJust a few simple taps are enough for your idle adventure.\r\nDefeat endless waves of monsters\r\nto level up your hero and get numerous items and monsters.\r\n\r\n\u2605 Dungeon Building and Management - Become  a dungeon tycoon!\r\nOnce you clear the first stage, you can build your own dungeon\r\nwhere you can mine mystical gemstones.\r\nYou can add new dungeons or expand one and go deeper.\r\n\r\n\u2605 Unique Dungeon Battles - Jump into a pillage war to steal from the others!\r\nYou can pillage another user\u2019s commodities by attacking their dungeon.\r\nYou can avenge yourself on the users who attacked you and make them pay.\r\n\r\n\u2605 Command troops with your own tactics - Be the captain of hundreds of monster troops!\r\nObtain around 240 kinds of monsters from the Adventure Mode.\r\nMonster troops can take charge of mining, defending, or attacking.\r\nAchieve victory by enhancing your monster troops and placing them strategically.\r\n\r\n\u2605 Unique items and merging - Easy and fun merge!\r\nYou can merge 3 items or 3 monsters of a kind to level them up.\r\nEvery item and monster can be useful with the easy and fun merge system.\r\n\r\nYou can easily grow your hero through auto-battle. All you have to do is focus on fighting and expanding your dungeon. \r\nDefeat rivals with your own strategies\r\nin this thrill-filled fantasy world!\r\n\r\nThe battle begins now!!!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Defend against monster waves and other users<br>and become the world&#39;s most powerful dungeon manager!<br><br>\u2605 Simple Hero Management - Arm them with powerful skills and items!<br>Just a few simple taps are enough for your idle adventure.<br>Defeat endless waves of monsters<br>to level up your hero and get numerous items and monsters.<br><br>\u2605 Dungeon Building and Management - Become  a dungeon tycoon!<br>Once you clear the first stage, you can build your own dungeon<br>where you can mine mystical gemstones.<br>You can add new dungeons or expand one and go deeper.<br><br>\u2605 Unique Dungeon Battles - Jump into a pillage war to steal from the others!<br>You can pillage another user\u2019s commodities by attacking their dungeon.<br>You can avenge yourself on the users who attacked you and make them pay.<br><br>\u2605 Command troops with your own tactics - Be the captain of hundreds of monster troops!<br>Obtain around 240 kinds of monsters from the Adventure Mode.<br>Monster troops can take charge of mining, defending, or attacking.<br>Achieve victory by enhancing your monster troops and placing them strategically.<br><br>\u2605 Unique items and merging - Easy and fun merge!<br>You can merge 3 items or 3 monsters of a kind to level them up.<br>Every item and monster can be useful with the easy and fun merge system.<br><br>You can easily grow your hero through auto-battle. All you have to do is focus on fighting and expanding your dungeon. <br>Defeat rivals with your own strategies<br>in this thrill-filled fantasy world!<br><br>The battle begins now!!!",
